{
  "info": {
    "name": "Delivery API - Fluxo Completo",
    "_postman_id": "delivery-api-collection",
    "description": "Collection completa da Delivery API.\n\n## Como usar:\n1. Importe o environment \"Delivery API - Local\"\n2. Execute as requests na ordem das pastas\n3. Os tokens e IDs são salvos automaticamente nas variáveis\n\n## Fluxo de Pagamento:\n1. Login (Auth) → tokens salvos\n2. Criar Loja + Produto (Setup)\n3. Criar Pedido (Orders)\n4. Simular Pagamento (Payments)\n5. Fluxo de Entrega (Deliveries)\n6. Confirmar Recebimento + Verificar Valores",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "description": "Login de todos os usuários. Execute na ordem.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login Cliente",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data && res.data.loginApp) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('customerToken', res.data.loginApp.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('customerId', res.data.loginApp.user.id);",
                  "  pm.test('Login cliente OK', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(res.data.loginApp.accessToken).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    pm.expect(res.data.loginApp.user.name).to.not.be.empty;",
                  "  });",
                  "} else {",
                  "  pm.test('Login cliente falhou', () => pm.expect.fail(JSON.stringify(res.errors)));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{graphqlUrl}}", "host": ["{{graphqlUrl}}"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "graphql",
              "graphql": {
                "query": "mutation LoginApp($input: LoginInput!) {\n  loginApp(input: $input) {\n    accessToken\n    user {\n      id\n      name\n      email\n      role\n      mpConnected\n    }\n  }\n}",
                "variables": "{\"input\":{\"email\":\"{{customerEmail}}\",\"password\":\"{{customerPassword}}\"}}"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Vendedor",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
